1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Cobro: invoices and a treasury agent for LatAm freelancers.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Clients pay in stablecoins on Celo. You keep pesos.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:16,067
The agent saves the rest in dollars, within your rules.

4
00:00:16,067 --> 00:00:27,067
Sign in with an email. No password, no seed phrase.

5
00:00:27,067 --> 00:00:31,567
Type the 6-digit code from your inbox.

6
00:00:31,567 --> 00:00:37,567
Your account and Celo wallets are created in the background.

7
00:00:37,567 --> 00:00:49,767
New invoice: client, what it's for, amount in pesos.

8
00:00:49,767 --> 00:00:54,767
Repeat every week: one link the client can bookmark.

9
00:00:54,767 --> 00:00:59,267
The preview shows exactly what your client will see.

10
00:00:59,267 --> 00:01:04,833
Create it and copy the payment link.

11
00:01:04,833 --> 00:01:08,833
The client opens the link. No account, no sign-up.

12
00:01:08,833 --> 00:01:13,333
Four currencies. USA₮ is recommended for US clients.

13
00:01:13,333 --> 00:01:17,833
Here the client pays in dollars (USD₮).

14
00:01:17,833 --> 00:01:26,333
One signature over x402. Cobro covers the network fee.

15
00:01:26,333 --> 00:01:34,833
Paid. Settled on Celo mainnet, straight to the freelancer.

16
00:01:34,833 --> 00:01:44,833
Back with the freelancer: the invoice is marked paid.

17
00:01:44,833 --> 00:01:51,333
Paid in pesos? The agent converts them to dollars on its own.

18
00:01:51,333 --> 00:01:56,833
It converts through Textile FX, within your caps and price limit.

19
00:01:56,833 --> 00:02:02,233
Every action explains why, with a tagged transaction.

20
00:02:02,233 --> 00:02:09,733
Cash out to your own wallet, or to an address you saved.

21
00:02:09,733 --> 00:02:14,733
New addresses are confirmed by email and wait 24 hours.

22
00:02:14,733 --> 00:02:26,033
The agent sends it and pays the network fee.

23
00:02:26,033 --> 00:02:37,733
Open your own wallet: the money has arrived.

24
00:02:37,733 --> 00:02:46,233
Every transaction Cobro sends carries its attribution tag.

25
00:02:46,233 --> 00:02:57,733
On Celoscan, the input data carries Cobro's tag.

26
00:02:57,733 --> 00:03:02,767
Cobro's agent is registered on ERC-8004 as agent #9884.

27
00:03:02,767 --> 00:03:08,767
So far: {freelancers} freelancers, {payments} payments, {conversions} agent conversions.

28
00:03:08,767 --> 00:03:12,767
cobro-agent.vercel.app. Your clients pay in dollars. You keep pesos.
